    entry_requirements = '<p>The University''s <a href="https://sharepointpubstor.blob.core.windows.net/policylibrary-prod/Admission%20Policy.pdf">Admission Policy</a> will apply.</p><p>Applicants for this Honours program must have successfully completed the Bachelor of Industrial Design (or equivalent) with a GPA of 5.0 (using a 7.0 point scale) over second and third year level courses.</p><p>The suitability of the proposed dissertation topic and availability of supervisors will also be considered.</p><p><strong>Note:</strong> Applicants are permitted to defer an offer subject to availability of supervisors upon recommencement. </p>',
