UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<p><strong>Queensland''s #1 university for both AI and economics.</strong> (ShanghaiRanking''s Global Ranking of Academic Subjects 2025)</p><p>Unlock your potential with a flexible business degree built for today''s fast-changing marketplace. Our online, on-demand Bachelor of Business gives you the freedom to shape your study around your interests, career goals and lifestyle. You''ll build core business skills, explore what drives modern organisations and graduate with the knowledge and confidence to lead in a world that values adaptability, innovation and purpose.</p><p>This degree offers an exploration of the forces that shape the business world, from entrepreneurship and economic trends to legal systems and government policy. You''ll learn how external and internal environments influence how organisations operate, compete, and grow. By understanding the broader context in which businesses function, you''ll be equipped to assess risks, spot emerging opportunities, and make sound strategic decisions that contribute to organisational success across a range of industries.</p><h6>Highlights of studying the Bachelor of Business&nbsp;</h6><ul><li>Study 100% online, on demand. Start when you''re ready, set your own pace and pause if you need to.</li><li>Tailor your study to suit your interests and career goals, with a wide range of elective options and the ability to choose a major after you''ve started your studies, you don''t have to decide right away. Once you''ve had time to explore your options, you can either continue without a specialisation or choose from majors in Business Analytics, Management, or Marketing.</li><li>Build adaptable skills in communication, strategy, leadership and problem-solving.</li><li>Learn the fundamentals of business and apply them to real-world challenges, guided by principles of sustainability, inclusion and equity.</li><li>Be supported with interactive activities, academic and student services and flexible study options designed to fit your life and give you a complete view of business strategy.</li><li>Graduate ready to pursue a wide range of career opportunities or continue into specialist postgraduate study.</li></ul><p><strong>This degree is part of </strong><a href="https://www.griffith.edu.au/study/griffith-go" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><strong>Griffith GO</strong></a><strong>, our 100% online, on-demand degrees that let you start when you''re ready, study at your own pace and learn from anywhere.</strong></p>',
    course_duration_per_week = 156,
    offshore_tuition_fee = NULL,
    onshore_tuition_fee = NULL,
    enrolment_fee = NULL,
    materials_fee = NULL,
    entry_requirements = '<p>Prerequisites: Nil</p><p>Assumed Knowledge: Any General or Applied English subject (Units 3 &amp; 4, C)</p><p>ATAR/Rank*: 63.00</p><p>VET Qualification: Certificate III</p><p><em>*The above ATAR/Rank from the 2026 admission cycle represents the minimum adjusted ATAR/Rank to which an offer was made. Minimum thresholds can change from year to year and should be used as a guide only for any future intakes.</em></p><p>The University''s <a href="https://sharepointpubstor.blob.core.windows.net/policylibrary-prod/Admission%20Policy.pdf">Admission Policy</a> will apply.</p>',
