UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<p>Shape the future of innovation with a Bachelor of Industrial Design. In this dynamic field, creativity meets engineering, allowing you to turn ideas into practical solutions. Through hands-on learning, you''ll master design principles and advanced manufacturing technologies, preparing you to create products that make a real impact.</p><h6>Highlights of studying the Bachelor of Industrial Design&nbsp;</h6><ul><li>Learn to design innovative products that improve lives in industries like healthcare and medical technology, automotive, fashion, aerospace and more.</li><li>Access cutting-edge technologies like 3D printing, digital modelling, electronics, mechanics and thermodynamics to design for both mass production and small-scale manufacturing.</li><li>Build skills in both creative design and technical manufacturing, ready to take a product from idea to final result.</li><li>Even if you study full-time on campus, you may be able to tailor your degree with flexible tutorials, online lectures and course materials.</li></ul><h6>Connect and collaborate with industry experts&nbsp;</h6><p>Work on real industry projects and assessments while learning from our teaching staff, who bring years of professional experience to guide and mentor you.</p><h6>Launch your career in industrial design&nbsp;</h6><p>Graduate with an industry-ready degree that gives you the skills and knowledge to succeed. With a focus on sustainable design and professional growth, you''ll be prepared to innovate and lead in industrial design at both local and global levels.&nbsp;</p>',
    course_duration_per_week = 156,
    offshore_tuition_fee = 126000,
    onshore_tuition_fee = NULL,
    enrolment_fee = NULL,
    materials_fee = NULL,
